    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>I&#39;m grateful for the recent additions to <a href=\"https://github.com/jcheng5/leaflet-shiny\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jcheng5/leaflet-shiny&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401395596000&amp;usg=AOvVaw16mRmgXpR_E4_lA6oyMitO\">leaflet-shiny</a> (geojson) but I&#39;ve been having difficulty for quite some time with adding overlays to my map. In particular, I need WMS layers.</div><div><br></div><div>Barring the inclusions of methods for WMS Tilelayers and control.layers into the main branch of the package, is there a way to inject custom JS code into the JS script generated by leaflet-shiny in the application or a way to alter the source code so that it will show these overlays? The selectable layers themselves are static. </div><div><br></div><div>Here&#39;s an HTML/JS example:</div><div><br></div><div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">&lt;html&gt;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">&lt;head&gt;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>&lt;title&gt;Leaflet GeoJSON Example&lt;/title&gt;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>&lt;meta charset=&quot;utf-8&quot; /&gt;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>&lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;<a href=\"http://cdn.leafletjs.com/leaflet-0.7.3/leaflet.css\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cdn.leafletjs.com/leaflet-0.7.3/leaflet.css&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401395596000&amp;usg=AOvVaw05TU-aqkipTpZS9g3P98F4\">http://cdn.leafletjs.com/leaflet-0.7.3/leaflet.css</a>&quot; /&gt;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">&lt;/head&gt;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">&lt;body&gt;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>&lt;div id=&quot;map&quot; style=&quot;width: 600px; height: 600px&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>&lt;script src=&quot;<a href=\"http://cdn.leafletjs.com/leaflet-0.7.3/leaflet.js\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cdn.leafletjs.com/leaflet-0.7.3/leaflet.js&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401395596000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0cPoqw-tRX8EBX6FxVa7SK\">http://cdn.leafletjs.com/leaflet-0.7.3/leaflet.js</a>&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>&lt;script&gt;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">        var nexrad = L.tileLayer.wms(&quot;<a href=\"http://mesonet.agron.iastate.edu/cgi-bin/wms/nexrad/n0r.cgi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mesonet.agron.iastate.edu/cgi-bin/wms/nexrad/n0r.cgi&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401395596000&amp;usg=AOvVaw08rChI4fIK7P-ZFVeEpF6J\">http://mesonet.agron.iastate.edu/cgi-bin/wms/nexrad/n0r.cgi</a>&quot;, {</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">        layers: &#39;nexrad-n0r-900913&#39;,</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">        format: &#39;image/png&#39;,</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">        transparent: true,</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">        attribution: &quot;Weather data © 2012 IEM Nexrad&quot;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">        });</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">        var OpenMapSurfer_Roads = L.tileLayer(&#39;<a href=\"http://openmapsurfer.uni-hd.de/tiles/roads/x=%7Bx%7D&amp;y=%7By%7D&amp;z=%7Bz%7D\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://openmapsurfer.uni-hd.de/tiles/roads/x%3D%257Bx%257D%26y%3D%257By%257D%26z%3D%257Bz%257D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401395596000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Wc3GjQ7GXewp1oIouyUew\">http://openmapsurfer.uni-hd.de/tiles/roads/x={x}&amp;y={y}&amp;z={z}</a>&#39;, {</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">            minZoom: 0,maxZoom: 20,</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">            attribution: &#39;Imagery from &lt;a href=&quot;<a href=\"http://giscience.uni-hd.de/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://giscience.uni-hd.de/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401395596000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0VJZ6QXTbxV-_deiULkuRM\">http://giscience.uni-hd.de/</a>&quot;&gt;GIScience Research Group @ University of Heidelberg&lt;/a&gt; &amp;mdash; Map data &amp;copy; &lt;a href=&quot;<a href=\"http://openstreetmap.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://openstreetmap.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401395596000&amp;usg=AOvVaw14aHBSCy7HGMraa9_PnqUi\">http://openstreetmap.org</a>&quot;&gt;OpenStreetMap&lt;/a&gt; contributors, &lt;a href=&quot;<a href=\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401395596000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1us94Ck2TwNGt78c-P2VAV\">http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/</a>&quot;&gt;CC-BY-SA&lt;/a&gt;&#39;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">        });</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">        var MapQuestOpen_Aerial = L.tileLayer(&#39;<a href=\"http://oatile\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://oatile&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401395596000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3aN-rsCiAtK49GtpE0N1xE\">http://oatile</a>{s}.<a href=\"http://mqcdn.com/tiles/1.0.0/sat/%7Bz%7D/%7Bx%7D/%7By%7D.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mqcdn.com/tiles/1.0.0/sat/%257Bz%257D/%257Bx%257D/%257By%257D.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401395596000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3u3ImYI7aN8mgZkgH7m4kL\">mqcdn.com/tiles/1.0.0/sat/{z}/{x}/{y}.jpg</a>&#39;, {</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>       attribution: &#39;Tiles Courtesy of &lt;a href=&quot;<a href=\"http://www.mapquest.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.mapquest.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792401395596000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0R7q-aLobyQPfYjobmd3Nb\">http://www.mapquest.com/</a>&quot;&gt;MapQuest&lt;/a&gt; &amp;mdash; Portions Courtesy NASA/JPL-Caltech and U.S. Depart. of Agriculture, Farm Service Agency&#39;,</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>       subdomains: &#39;1234&#39;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">        });</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>var map = L.map(&#39;map&#39;, {</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>center: [29.53, -95.89],</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>zoom: 4,</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>layers: [OpenMapSurfer_Roads]</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>});</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>var baseLayers = {</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">            &quot;MapQuestOpen_Aerial&quot;: MapQuestOpen_Aerial,</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>&quot;OpenMapSurfer_Roads&quot;: OpenMapSurfer_Roads</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>};</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">        var overlays = {</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">            &quot;Precipitation&quot;: nexrad.addTo(map)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>};        </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>L.control.layers(baseLayers, overlays).addTo(map);</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>&lt;/script&gt;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">&lt;/body&gt;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">&lt;/html&gt;</font></div></div><div><br></div><div>You can see that by using an IDE that includes a server such as Brackets, or by running it in R-Studio as an index.html.</div><div><br></div><div>Any help in this matter would be greatly greatly appreciated.</div><div><br></div><div>Regards,</div><div><br></div><div>Chris</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
